Bootstrap Popover
Popover — elementga click qilganda chiqadigan kattaroq oyna.
Tooltip  → qisqa text, odatda hover bilan
Popover  → ko‘proq content, odatda click bilan
1. Basic Popover
<a href="#"
   data-toggle="popover"
   title="Popover Header"
   data-content="Bu popover ichidagi content.">
    Click me
</a>
2. Popoverni ishga tushirish
<script>
$(document).ready(function(){
    $('[data-toggle="popover"]').popover();
});
</script>
33. Bootstrap Popover
→ Click qilganda chiqadigan popup box.

data-toggle="popover"
→ Popoverni bildiradi

title
→ Popover header

data-content
→ Popover body/content

.popover()
→ Popoverni initialize qiladi

data-placement="top"
→ yuqorida

data-placement="bottom"
→ pastda

data-placement="left"
→ chapda

data-placement="right"
→ o‘ngda

data-placement="auto"
→ joyni avtomatik tanlaydi

data-trigger="focus"
→ tashqariga click qilganda yopiladi

data-trigger="hover"
→ hover qilganda ochiladi
